loader with slot bootloader version 2 (GUIDE.md sections 10 and 11). Install: `python3 -I tools/lc1020e.py update APP_OWN.uf2 --yes`, or update mode and copy APP_OWN.uf2 onto the drive LC1020E-IAP. APP_OWN.bin is the same image (0x08006000, 318456 bytes, CRC-32 0x3597220C). STARTER.bin: the starter of the bootloader. The slot bootloader images are built from your own meter's dump (`make -C bootloader vendor-data DUMP=...`, GUIDE.md section 10). SHA256SUMS lists the checksums."}]